ICML-2024-P0230,ICML-2024-A001025,Jun Cen,shared,3,9,9,"Which object would the person put down next? Which object would the person put down next? Text Text LLM Language Planning Step : What is the person holding? Step : What actions has the person performed with the objects so far? Step : Which object would the person put down next? Language Plan LMM The bottle or phone. LMM bottle bottle LVM phone phone bottle Vision Planning phone phone Step Image / Video Image / Video The bottle Output Output bottle Step bottle phone Step Vision Plan (a) Existing works (b) Ours Figure . Existing Large Multi-modality Models (LMMs) directly make the decision based on text and image inputs. Our Vision-Language Planning (VLP) framework conducts both language planning and vision planning first, which serves as the left hemisphere and the right hemisphere of a human brain, and then uses an LMM for the final decision making.",-18,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P0230.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/cen24a/cen24a.pdf
