ICML-2024-P0363,ICML-2024-A001729,Nathaniel Cohen,shared,3,5,5,"A man is surfing A humanoid robot is jumping Iron Man is surfing A shiny silver robot is jumping Spider Man is surfing Edited Input A man is jumping Figure : Slicedit. We present a zero-shot method for text-based video editing based on a pretrained text-to-image diffusion model. Our method can edit challenging long videos with complex nonrigid motion and occlusions, while preserving the regions not specified in the text prompt (e.g. changing only the person into a robot without affecting the background). See our website for video results.",-6,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P0363.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/cohen24a/cohen24a.pdf
