ICML-2024-P1692,ICML-2024-A008445,Zi-Hao Qiu,shared,3,6,6,"Table . Evaluations on Instrucation Following Capabilities using AlpacaEval2 . TT stands for training time measured by GPU hours on A100-80G GPUs. The evaluations of the TempNet-enabled models were conducted in April, and the results of other models are from Alpaca leaderboad in April, . The win rate measures the fraction of time the model’s output is preferred over the GPT4_turbo’s outputs. Length controlled (LC) win-rates are a debiased version of the win-rates that control for the length of the outputs. More details for our training can be found in Section . .",-6,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P1692.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/qiu24c/qiu24c.pdf
