ICML-2024-P2277,ICML-2024-A011261,Changming Xu,shared,3,2,2,"classify. While there is a large amount of work on generating adversarial perturbations (Szegedy et al., ; Goodfellow et al., ; Madry et al., ; Carlini and Wagner, ; Xiao et al., 2018a; Dong et al., ; Croce and Hein, ; Wang et al., ; Zheng et al., ; Andriushchenko et al., ; Tramèr et al., ), these works depend upon unrealistic assumptions about the power of the attacker: the attacker knows the DNN input in advance, generates inputspecific perturbations in real-time and exactly combines the perturbation with the input before being processed by the DNN. Thus, we argue that these threat models are not realizable in many real-world applications.",-6,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P2277.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/xu24v/xu24v.pdf
ICML-2024-P2277,ICML-2024-A011262,Gagandeep Singh,shared,3,2,2,"classify. While there is a large amount of work on generating adversarial perturbations (Szegedy et al., ; Goodfellow et al., ; Madry et al., ; Carlini and Wagner, ; Xiao et al., 2018a; Dong et al., ; Croce and Hein, ; Wang et al., ; Zheng et al., ; Andriushchenko et al., ; Tramèr et al., ), these works depend upon unrealistic assumptions about the power of the attacker: the attacker knows the DNN input in advance, generates inputspecific perturbations in real-time and exactly combines the perturbation with the input before being processed by the DNN. Thus, we argue that these threat models are not realizable in many real-world applications.",-6,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P2277.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/xu24v/xu24v.pdf
