ICML-2024-P2570,ICML-2024-A012855,Xiaoyu Zhou,shared,3,8,8,"Ours Latent-NeRF LucidDreamer Set-the-scene “A rabbit is eating a birthday cake at the dining table” “Panda in a wizard hat sitting on a wooden chair and looking at a ficus in a pot” Interactive Editing “A table with a roasted turkey, a salad, a loaf of French bread, a glass of orange juice and an empty plate on it” “A living room has a coffee table with a basket on it, a wooden floor, a TV on a TV stand, and a sofa with an astronaut sitting on” “Add a cardboard box” “Delete the table and basket” “Move sofa forward and rotate ° ” Figure : GALA3D generates high-quality complex 3D scenes and supports interactive controllable editing. Existing methods either produce low-quality textures, visual artifacts, and geometric distortions or fail to accurately generate multiple objects and their interactions according to the text.",-16,data/raw/icml/2024/first_pages/ICML-2024-P2570.txt,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v235/main/assets/zhou24p/zhou24p.pdf
